      "raw": "<p>For Bunker&#39;s card which says&nbsp;&quot;a second target&quot; and &quot;a third target&quot;, they have to be different because otherwise it isn&#39;t a second and third target, it is just the first one again.&nbsp; Most cards are written like this.</p><p>There are a few cards (Argent Adept and Chrono Ranger) which just say deal a target some damage, deal a target some other damage.&nbsp; This can be the same target both times.</p>",
