      "id": 59535,
      "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
      "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-11T14:47:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It has to be different targets. Certain cards can hit the same target twice, but they're worded differently; The Argent Adept's Scherzo of Frost and Flame says \"AA deals 1 target cold damage, then deals 1 target fire damage\", rather than \"deals 1 target cold damage, then deals a&nbsp;<strong>second&nbsp;</strong>target fire damage\", or \"deals 2 targets cold damage.\" The former can hit the same target twice, the latter two cannot.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:35:21.630Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
